---
args: { goals: LearningEvidenceMap, calendar: MilestoneCalendar, complication: ComplicationDecision }
returns: ProjectReadiness
---
Block when a mandatory goal has no feasible demonstration, the dependency order is cyclic, or the late-complication check removed a required goal. Mark review when learner attribution or material equivalence remains unresolved. Mark proposed only when each mandatory goal survives and every learner has an attributable feasible evidence path.
